{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]我首先要为我之前的态度表示歉意。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]虽然知道你们是帮助村子的恩人，但对于[color=ffb64d]荒野客[colorEnd]的偏见，还是蒙蔽了我的眼睛。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]不过我看到了你们之后的行动。你们帮助我们夺回了磨牙溪谷，还救回了孩子们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]在你们的善意面前，我实在无地自容。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]为了洗刷这份愧疚，我必须道歉来请求你们的原谅。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]呃……你怎么态度突然掉了一个个儿？你真的没问题吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]我们[color=ffb64d]蜥蜴人[colorEnd]就是这样的，我们绝不会放过一个仇敌，但也绝不会亏待一个朋友！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]既然我之前对你们有所亏欠，那我就必须进行弥补，[r]否则就是在让我的家族、我的部落蒙羞！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_34"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]呃……倒也不必如此……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_35"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]必须如此！不要觉得我是在空口说白话，我所说的补偿是[color=ffb64d]实实在在[colorEnd]的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_36"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]这就是我叫你们来的原因，我要告诉你们一个只有少数人才知道的秘密。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]在我们这，连小孩子都知道，蛇腹矿坑中的确存在着一种[color=ffb64d]元素矿石[colorEnd]。这些矿石中蕴含着不同属性的元素能量，通常被法师们用来制造附魔装备。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]但是，极少有人知道，只要使用特定的方式服用和吸收这些矿石，[r]矿石内的能量，就会帮助你[color=ffb64d]突破极限[colorEnd]，从而大幅提升[color=ffb64d]战斗力[colorEnd]！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_37"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]还有这种事？你就这么把这么重要的秘密告诉我们？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_38"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]这个秘密当然重要，但我现在身无长物，也没有别的东西可以补偿你们。[r]既然你们身手了得，也肯定有办法利用这份情报——我是这么判断的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_39"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]是吗？那就多谢你了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_42"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]不过蛇腹矿坑里不是在闹蜘蛛嘛。这部分怎么办？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]这就是你们考虑的问题了。我不觉得你们契约者会惧怕什么矿坑里涌出来的蜘蛛，而放弃手到擒来的变强之法。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"这的确是不会。","tag":"tag_27"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show][cm]这包元素石是我之前珍藏下来的存货，我将它赠予你们。剩下如果你们还需要，就得靠自己的力量去采掘了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_45"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哇！谢谢你！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_46"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"武具匠瑟尔妲","text":"[show]这样我们就两清了。欢迎你们随时过来，我永远都会是你们契约者忠诚的盟友。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_43"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":360,"mirrow":false,"y":-180,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]那……我们现在要回去蛇腹矿坑看看吗？离和茜塔她们汇合倒是还有不少时间。如果能趁闲，去试试变强的方法也不错？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"好，那我们先回去准备一下吧！","tag":"tag_44"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_44"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]好！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"瑟尔妲：元素石采集","script":"m_1_7_5"}